From: Vadim <vmilyash@mts.ru>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 07:27:23 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 01/10] feat(platform): per-cluster read limiter (ADR-0026)

Process-wide counter of concurrent reads per cluster (default 4, KUBRON_OPS_CLUSTER_CONCURRENCY), cancel-aware, no slot or map entry leaks.

Signed-off-by: Vadim <vmilyash@mts.ru>
---
